      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef greedy_change(amount, coins):\n    used = []\n    for coin in sorted(coins, reverse=True):\n        while amount >= coin:\n            amount -= coin\n            used.append(coin)\n    return used\n\n\nprint(greedy_change(87, [1, 5, 10, 25, 50]))\nprint(greedy_change(6, [4, 1, 3]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef greedy_change(amount, coins):\n    used = []\n    for coin in sorted(coins, reverse=True):\n        while amount >= coin:\n            amount -= coin\n            used.append(coin)\n    return used\n\n\nprint(greedy_change(87, [1, 5, 10, 25, 50]))\nprint(greedy_change(6, [4, 1, 3]))\n```"
    }
